---
import BaseLayout from "../layouts/BaseLayout.astro";
---

<BaseLayout
  title="Privacy"
  description="Privacy information for the Basil N G backend engineering portfolio."
  canonicalPath="/privacy/"
>
  <article class="section">
    <div class="container container--narrow">
      <header class="case-header">
        <p class="eyebrow">Site information</p>
        <h1>Privacy</h1>
        <p class="lead">
          This page explains the limited analytics and performance information collected by this
          portfolio.
        </p>
      </header>

      <section aria-labelledby="analytics-heading">
        <h2 id="analytics-heading">Web analytics</h2>

        <p>
          This site uses Vercel Web Analytics to understand aggregate traffic, including page views,
          popular pages, referrers, approximate geographic region, browser, operating system and
          device category.
        </p>

        <p>
          The analytics service is used only to understand general site usage and improve the
          portfolio. It is not used for advertising, behavioural profiling or selling visitor
          information.
        </p>
      </section>

      <section aria-labelledby="performance-heading">
        <h2 id="performance-heading">Performance monitoring</h2>

        <p>
          This site uses Vercel Speed Insights to collect anonymous performance measurements such as
          Core Web Vitals, route, device category, browser and network characteristics.
        </p>

        <p>
          These measurements help identify slow pages and improve the site's reliability,
          accessibility and user experience.
        </p>
      </section>

      <section aria-labelledby="cookies-heading">
        <h2 id="cookies-heading">Cookies</h2>

        <p>
          Vercel Web Analytics does not use third-party cookies for visitor analytics. This
          portfolio does not use advertising cookies.
        </p>
      </section>

      <section aria-labelledby="sensitive-data-heading">
        <h2 id="sensitive-data-heading">Sensitive information</h2>

        <p>
          Do not include passwords, access tokens, personal identifiers or other sensitive
          information in URLs or query parameters when visiting this site.
        </p>
      </section>

      <section aria-labelledby="processor-heading">
        <h2 id="processor-heading">Service provider</h2>

        <p>
          The website is hosted by Vercel, which processes the analytics and performance
          measurements used by this portfolio.
        </p>

        <p>
          More information is available in the
          <a href="https://vercel.com/legal/privacy-policy"> Vercel privacy notice </a>.
        </p>
      </section>

      <section aria-labelledby="updated-heading">
        <h2 id="updated-heading">Last updated</h2>
        <p>30 July 2026</p>
      </section>
    </div>
  </article>
</BaseLayout>
